{"title":"Antlion Pitling","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 15 Antlion that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling?lv=15\">Lv 15</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling?lv=19\">Lv 19 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling?lv=15\" title=\"Pick level 15\"><td><b>15</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>46</td><td>12.8</td><td>750</td><td class=\"muted\">138 · 17.9 · 2,250</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling?lv=19\" title=\"Pick level 19\"><td><b>19</b></td><td>61</td><td>15</td><td>950</td><td class=\"muted\">183 · 21 · 2,850</td><td>6</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 9 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"chitin-plate\" title=\"Chitin Plate - in 78% of 9 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 12 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e7a114aeae3b63b5e56d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Chitin Plate</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">78% · 7/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"antlion-mandible\" title=\"Antlion Mandible - in 56% of 9 looted corpses, 5 recorded drops, 9 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3af9398e31b21e1c0d76.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Antlion Mandible</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">56% · 5/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 31 total, 31 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/9</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-legs\" title=\"Snakeskin Legs - in 11% of 9 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/fd826e0571f2523a171c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">11% · 1/9</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chi